New VIDEO_STYLE=kids: 2-3 min animated story videos explaining one finance/tech idea
with a kid-world analogy (all ages, not made for kids).

- agents/kids_scene_schema.py: 16 beat-driven story scenes, 36 props, 7-kid cast,
  validate_and_repair (never fatal on bad LLM output)
- agents/kids/: pycairo renderer (cast, props, scenes, beat/cue timeline, captions,
  thumbnail, generated music bed, Kokoro/Piper voice), bundled Fredoka (OFL)
- agents/kids_agent.py: voice per line -> timeline -> render -> QA (<=180 s) -> thumb/SRT/contact sheet
- agents/kids_script_agent.py + templates/kids_prompts.py: analogy plan -> scenes -> length guard -> checker
- agents/kids_topic_agent.py + data/kids_topics.json: headline -> evergreen idea, bank fallback
- orchestrator --style kids, KIDS_* config, .github/workflows/kids_explainer.yml
  (03:47 UTC, dry run until KIDS_SCHEDULED_DRY_RUN=false)
- tests/test_kids.py (44 tests) + 2 fixtures; docs/PLAN_KIDS_EXPLAINER.md

